    "description": {
      "content": "Welcome to the Swagger documentation for ALTR's Service User API. This API allows ALTR customers to manage service users used to connect to third-party applications such as Snowflake.\nAPI credentials can be obtained under Settings > Preferences > API of ALTR's portal for Usernames are the 'Key Names' listed on that page and Passwords are the 'Key Secret' provided when an API key is created.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Support\n Email: support@altr.com",
